snp2.14:10.2 | S: and the layfolk too are here to listen. | T: and the lay followers, right there—to hear.
snp2.14:10.3 | S: Let them hear the teaching <j>the immaculate one discovered, | T: Let them listen to the Dhamma awakened to by one who is stainless,
