snp2.14:31.2 | P: maṅgalaṁ sūcilomena; | T: (none)
snp2.14:31.3 | P: Dhammacariyañca brāhmaṇo, | T: (none)
snp2.14:31.4 | P: nāvā kiṁsīlamuṭṭhānaṁ. | T: (none)
